Database migrations (Alembic is the single source of truth for schema).

## Local development

From the `be/` directory:

```bash
# Apply all pending migrations
alembic upgrade head

# Or via Makefile
make migrate

# Migrate then start dev server
make dev
```

## Create a new migration

```bash
alembic revision --autogenerate -m "describe change"
alembic upgrade head
```

## Container / production

Migrations run before the app starts via `scripts/entrypoint.sh`:

```bash
alembic upgrade head && uvicorn main:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 4000
```

Build and run:

```bash
docker build -t ecommerce-be .
docker run --rm -p 4000:4000 --env-file .env ecommerce-be
```

## Health checks

- `GET /health` — liveness (process is running)
- `GET /ready` — readiness (database + redis are reachable)
